ia em diversas áreas, incluindo o esporte.', 499.99, 340.09, NULL, 'Computers & Accessories > Desktop & Laptop Components > PC Cases', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rfhx-m3p86n85m8ilde', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F627750190%2F22298097722', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
