icante VFCI1660 WEG >', 13.16, 13.16, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > Filters', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rbk2-llxhvp7gsaspc7', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F817551928%2F19061907510', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
