iver, tweeter, reposição, áudio profissional, Force One, ST-304, kit com 6 unidades.', 115.9, 89.25, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Internal Accessories for Automobiles > Car Audio System', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7renz-m1zkeobh8t13e9', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F339582052%2F22397997650', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
